# Project
BookMyShow-style ticket booking backend. See @AGENTS.md and @docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.

## Stack
NestJS (TypeScript strict), PostgreSQL, TypeORM, Redis/BullMQ, JWT, Jest.

## Conventions
- Modular monolith: one folder per domain in `src/modules/<name>/`.
- File names: kebab-case (`create-booking.dto.ts`); classes PascalCase; DB columns snake_case.
- API prefix `/api/v1`. Responses: `{ success, data, message }` via global interceptor.
- Config via `@nestjs/config` + validated env schema. Never read `process.env` directly in modules.
- Money: integer minor units (paise) in `bigint`/`int`. Never floats.
- Timestamps: `timestamptz`, UTC.
- IDs: UUID v4 for public entities.
- No `any`. No unused code. No commented-out code. No console.log (use Nest `Logger`).
- Keep functions small; business logic in services only.

## Workflow
- Do one task at a time from `docs/TASKS.md`.
- Don't add dependencies without asking.
- Before saying a task is done: run lint, build, tests and report results.
- Record gotchas in `docs/MEMORY.md`.
